You are given an integer array `nums` and two integers `indexDiff` and `valueDiff`. Find a pair of indices `(i, j)` such that: `i != j`, `abs(i - j) <= indexDiff` and `abs(nums[i] - nums[j]) <= valueDiff`.@@2025@@

